35:- **R-029 | p.1 hybrid frame — two text paths per turn** — рутина = picking a ready bank record (Челнок, executor code, latency units–tens of seconds); unique/emotional = Ткач (executor LLM): engine feeds ready facts+instructions, model writes text; emotion = Ткач generation parameter, not bank record attribute; bank = insurance: if Ткач exceeds silence threshold, Челнок serves a backup bank record, generation failure never stops play. Lineage: TNS35 Шестёрка = 6 LLM calls/turn ≈5 min; TNS45 = 1–2 calls, 5–8 s; TNS55 = 0 calls target ≤2 s but killed unique/emotional. Turn steps: (1) replica → conveyor p.9 (code); (2) Пила rates depth p.6: peak → Ткач path, flat → Челнок path (Пила proposes, Селектор decides); (3) Челнок picks phrase by scene tags — 0 calls, ms; (4) Ткач writes from assembled prompt, deep scene ≈30–60 s at ~5.6 tok/s (p.5); (5) streaming underlay p.11 while Ткач writes (code); (6) two-level insurance: silence > threshold → Челнок backup record; external provider refused → slot degrades to local backup (p.14), turn always delivered; (7) third text source = осевшие live scenes (p.10): insurance on Ткач silence, middle layer on flat segments, draft for Ткач in a similar moment; peak always written by live Ткач. Example numbers: prompt ~1.5–2k tokens, Ткач output ~200–300 tokens ≈ 35–55 s; refusal at 45th second → threshold exceeded → backup served. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:150–166. Status: CANON.
89:- **R-080 | Model layers** — станок local: :5001 generation 3B q4 ~5.6 tok/s (deep scenes only, raised on demand), :5002 BGE-M3 dim 1024 resident ~2.4 GB, lemmatizer pymorphy3 ~100 MB; external (swappable slots): Ткач/Редактор prose, deep-parse cheap call, Паганель large external LLM on owner key (UI card). Three presets, default local; config requirements per R-010. Source: DOCS/02-ARCHITECTURE.md:97–121. Status: PLAN.
111:- **R-102 | Станок layout (06)** — :5001 generation 3B q4 (~5.6 tok/s, raised only for deep scenes), :5002 embeddings BGE-M3 dim 1024 (~2.4 GB, live-loop resident), lemmatizer pymorphy3 (~100 MB); combined memory ≈ 0.1 + 2.4 GB; vector on ORIGINAL text (TNS35 contract). Source: DOCS/06-MODELS-AND-SEED.md:27–39. Status: PLAN.
