14:- **R-008 | p.14 roles, not model names** — canon fixes roles/interfaces/requirements; current composition (BGE-M3 on :5002, local 3B станок, pack lemmatizer) = replaceable implementation. Lemmatizer = deterministic dictionary service (RU pack = pymorphy3, MIT), ~100 MB resident, ms per replica, stdio/JSON contract (lemma, POS, tags), negation «не» = separate lemma. Ткач and Редактор prose = uncensored and/or literary-tuned model, external loop (CPU: 4 cores, no GPU, ceiling ~3B q4). Deep parse of first replica = one cheap LLM call per chapter. Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:28–36. Status: CANON.
15:- **R-009 | Language pack composition** — lemmatizer + intent lexicon + ban-lists + word detectors (time, mood); base seed pools translated to pack language once at pack build, one voice (translation = pack-build op, not live-turn role). Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:38. Status: CANON.
16:- **R-010 | Model slots and presets** — Ткач/deep-parse slots filled by local model (model manager) or external API (owner key, UI settings); three factory presets: «локально — слабая машина», «локально — средняя», «внешние API», default local. Three config requirements: bank wording stable (repeats served identically, p.3); external-slot failure degrades to local backup, turn never dies (p.1); pack dictionary control slot-independent (p.9). Source: TNS65-PARADIGM.md:40. Status: CANON.
